{"id": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN", "offset": 3345, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 3168, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN", "offset": 3350, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f0fa8143f9a9fa48f94bf366f2618148", "baseline_text": "자，한 번 해 볼까？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "さて、いっちょやるか？", "pointer_offset": 3172, "unit": "dialogue:d5282a202801e5cc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN", "offset": 3984, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0bcf0d7f0b9f147f15781432f2ff99cf64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf0a8f8b1f3498144", "baseline_text": "이 시합에서는，//내 패가//보너스 패라나 봐．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//俺のパイが//ボーナスパイだってよ。", "pointer_offset": 3176, "unit": "dialogue:126d97b42ffb769f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN", "offset": 3424, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff957f0b2f1c8f0d3f144f7d12f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e72f2ff1e1f15ff9c7f243f957f1c8f0a98144", "baseline_text": "이번 주제는 이거인가…//이 중에서，어느 한 세트를//맞추면 되는 거군．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題はこれか……//この中の、どれか１組を//そろえればいいんだな。", "pointer_offset": 3180, "unit": "dialogue:0cf9b3eb72a161f1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN", "offset": 4025, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af81432f2ff19cf944f5f3f0c7f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "좋아，//내가 딜러다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よっしゃ、//俺が親だな！", "pointer_offset": 3184, "unit": "dialogue:1353723123a82bf1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN", "offset": 3520, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f0fa8143f0f0f944f5f3f0c7f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "자，네가 딜러다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "さあ、おめぇが親だ。", "pointer_offset": 3188, "unit": "dialogue:3153e8aa39fede12", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN", "offset": 3541, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f372f372f372f7d12f2ff15af16e81442f2ff25af8f4f0affb74f4dcf1f3f168f2a98144", "baseline_text": "헤헤헤…//어때．//너도 아직 멀었구먼．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "へへへ……//どうだい。//おめぇもまだまだ甘えぜ。", "pointer_offset": 3192, "unit": "dialogue:4a9ae1eacc47034e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN", "offset": 3590, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0b5816081432f2ff0dff2d1f0d3f18d81442f2ff0f0f944f0b2f3bbf0cff7d1f3b1f6808144", "baseline_text": "오～，//제법인데．//네가 이겼다…흐읍．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ほお～、//やるじゃねぇか。//おめぇの勝ちだ……ひっく。", "pointer_offset": 3196, "unit": "dialogue:2627b86fc59c1dac", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN", "offset": 3645, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3fb55f2d5f293f8e7f24cf24df8b6f19cf148f29ef0a981442f2ff0fa8143f9a9faf9fab8f257f2618148", "baseline_text": "다음엔 승부를 확실히 내야겠군．//자，한 판 더 할까？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次は白黒つけねぇとな。//ほれ、もっかいやるか？", "pointer_offset": 3200, "unit": "dialogue:fff660a8ea4373b5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN", "offset": 3692, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b5f25af2a9f0d2f944f3a1f259f8c8f16e", "baseline_text": "토너먼트가 끝났을 때", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝ち抜き戦が終わった時", "pointer_offset": 3204, "unit": "dialogue:bb0e5833a13689be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN", "offset": 3715, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 3208, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT16YONE.SBN", "offset": 3738, "capacity": 19, "raw_hex": "5f6a6f625f637572736f725f616e696d617465", "baseline_text": "_job_cursor_animate", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_job_cursor_animate", "pointer_offset": 3212, "unit": "dialogue:0dd10e8d7b60ab63", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
